  completeQuest: []
  startQuest:
  - "K\u1EC3 t\u1EEB chuy\u1EBFn r\xE8n luy\u1EC7n \u1EDF Thi\xEAn Tinh Th\xE0nh
    v\u1EC1... m\u1EA5y l\xE3o gi\xE0 h\u1ECD H\xE0 kia... \u0111\xE3 b\u1EAFt nh\u1ED1t
    con b\xE9 H\xE0 Ch\xE2m \u1EDF trong nh\xE0 r\u1ED3i! Nghe \u0111\xE2u... con
    b\xE9 l\xE0 C\u1EF1c \xC2m Chi Th\u1EC3... B\xEAn \u0111\xF3 \u0111ang chu\u1EA9n
    b\u1ECB l\u1EC5 c\u01B0\u1EDBi... cho n\xF3... v\xE0 t\xEAn thi\u1EBFu ch\u1EE7
    c\u1EE7a Qu\u1EF7 Linh M\xF4n!"
  - "Ta nghi ng\u1EDD... trong chuy\u1EC7n n\xE0y c\xF3 tr\xE1! V\xE0 con b\xE9...
    c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng h\u1EC1 t\xECnh nguy\u1EC7n. Ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn... m\u1EA5y
    l\xE3o gi\xE0 kia \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB mua chu\u1ED9c... v\xE0 Qu\u1EF7 Linh M\xF4n
    b\u1ECDn ch\xFAng... \u0111ang c\xF3 \xE2m m\u01B0u g\xEC \u0111\xF3... \u0111\u1ED1i
    v\u1EDBi C\u1EF1c \xC2m Chi Th\u1EC3!"
  - "Ta... th\xEC kh\xF4ng ti\u1EC7n ra m\u1EB7t. Nh\u01B0ng n\u1EBFu l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u01A1i...
    th\xEC ta ngh\u0129... c\xF3 th\u1EC3 c\u1EE9u \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c con b\xE9!
    N\u1EBFu ng\u01B0\u01A1i... c\u0169ng c\xF3 ch\xFAt c\u1EA3m t\xECnh v\u1EDBi
    n\xF3... th\xEC h\xE3y \u0111i \u0111i! C\xF2n b\xEAn ph\xEDa t\xF4ng m\xF4n
    n\xE0y... c\u1EE9 \u0111\u1EC3 ta lo."
  - "H\xE3y c\u1EA9n th\u1EADn!"
